## Overview
This project is designed to monitor and manage water distribution using IoT.

## Features
- Monitors water level, flow, and quality
- Automatic valve control
- Real-time monitoring using mobile app

## Technologies Used
- Arduino UNO
- ESP8266 NodeMCU
- IoT (Blynk App)
- Sensors (Float, Flow, Turbidity)

## How It Works
Sensors collect data → Arduino processes → Controls valves → Sends data to cloud → Displayed on mobile app
